{"id":"H4429","lemma":"מֶ֫לֶךְ","transliteration":"melekh","sayIt":"me-lekh","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Melech","meaning":"A man of the tribe of Benjamin living at the time of United Monarchy, first mentioned at 1Ch.8.35;\nson of: Micah (H4318H);\nbrother of: Pithon (H6377), Tarea (H8390) and Ahaz (H0271H)\n§ Melech = \"king\"\na Benjamite, the 2nd son of Micah and grandson of Mephibosheth","glosses":["melech"],"count":2,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"1ch-8","v":35,"renderings":{"bsb":"Melech","kjv":"and Melech"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-9","v":41,"renderings":{"bsb":"Melech","kjv":"and Melech"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"1 Chronicles 8:35","note":"The sons of Micah: Pithon, Melech, Tarea, and Ahaz.","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H0271","lemma":"אָחָז","transliteration":"achaz","gloss":"Ahaz"},{"id":"H4318","lemma":"מִיכָה","transliteration":"mikhah","gloss":"Micah"},{"id":"H6377","lemma":"פִּיתוֹן","transliteration":"piton","gloss":"Pithon"},{"id":"H8390","lemma":"תַּאֲרֵעַ","transliteration":"taarea","gloss":"Tarea"},{"id":"H4316","lemma":"מִיכָא","transliteration":"mikah","gloss":"Mica"},{"id":"H8475","lemma":"תַּחֲרֵעַ","transliteration":"tachrea","gloss":"Tahrea"}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}